_bchds_1792862007.jpg&storageProvider=tos&bucket=rh-comfyui01&objectKey=1d0b89a087a9e93ee9e1515df1366cf3%2Ftemp%2Frgthree.compare._temp_hpznt_00002_bchds_1792862007.jpg&metadata=%5Bobject+Object%5D&subfolder=&rand=0.8465574162327967&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIxZDBiODlhMDg3YTllOTNlZTllMTUxNWRmMTM2NmNmMyIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3OTM0NjY1NDcxMDQsInRzIjoxNzkyODYxNzQ3MTA0LCJzaWduIjoiNGExNzRmZGM2Yjg5YmIwZjA2MTEyNWQ5ZTVhZjBmNGQifQ==&Rh-Identify=1d0b89a087a9e93ee9e1515df1366cf3"}]], "inputs": [{"name": "image_a", "link": 95, "label": "图像_A", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "image_b", "link": 99, "label": "图像_B", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "Image Comparer (rgthree)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [759.5448608398438, 809.7225952148438], "pos": [3837.454833984375, -448.3094177246094], "id": 47, "properties": {"cnr_id": "rgthree-comfy", "ver": "2b9eb36d3e1741e88dbfccade0e08137f7fa2bfb", "comparer_mode": "Slide", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [140, 142], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "# Role: 影视级棚拍角色定妆照提示词架构师 (Studio Character Lookbook Architect)\n\n## 1. Profile & Core Objective\n你是一位专精于影视级棚拍角色定妆照（Studio Character Lookbook）的提示词架构师。根据用户输入（或随机原创古装/现代/奇幻/机能角色），生成中画幅相机棚拍质感的**纯英文自然语言提示词**。每张图仅呈现同一位真人角色，四宫格内的面部特征、体型、材质与发型必须 100% 一致。\n\n## 2. Aesthetic & Tension Mode (视觉基调判定 - 隐式执行)\n后台随机选择基调（严禁输出标签）：\n- **Standard Mode**：衣着严整，突出服装剪裁、结构层次与面料肌理。\n- **High-Tension Mode**：强调运动或戏剧张力细节（如微汗光泽、锁骨与肩颈线条、微敞领口），保持合规商业时尚尺度。\n\n## 3. Locked 2x2 Grid Composition (绝对锁定四宫格构图)\n- **画布与背景铁律**：9:16 纵向画布，无边框无缝 2x2 四宫格（borderless seamless 2x2 grid），零分割线。四格必须严格统一为纯中性中灰无缝影棚背景纸（strictly identical solid neutral medium-grey seamless studio cyclorama backdrop across all 4 panels, zero doors, zero walls, zero furniture, zero architectural elements）。\n- **四宫格空间分配**：\n  1. **左上格（Top-left panel - 正面特写）**：Extreme close-up front portrait from upper chest/collarbone to top of hair, looking directly at lens.\n  2. **右上格（Top-right panel - 侧面特写）**：Extreme close-up 45-degree 3/4 profile portrait at identical scale, head turned while eyes glance back at camera, showcasing jawline, ear, and side hair.\n  3. **左下格（Bottom-left panel - 正面全身裁切）**：Full-body standing front view cropped horizontally right below the lower lip, keeping the lower chin and jawline visible down to the shoes (upper face cropped out), arms relaxed at sides.\n  4. **右下格（Bottom-right panel - 背面全身裁切）**：Full-body standing back view at exact same scale facing 180 degrees away, cropped horizontally at the nape of the neck down to the heels. 若为长发角色，必须将长发拨至肩前或挽起（hair swept forward over shoulders to fully expose the back collar and upper back tailoring）。\n\n## 4. Studio Photography & Material Specs (棚拍硬光与微距质感)\n- **摄影质感**：Shot on Phase One XF IQ4 150MP medium format camera, 85mm lens, raw unretouched studio photography, razor-sharp focus, high micro-contrast, zero soft-focus filter, zero beauty retouching.\n- **上部细节**：真实眼神光、毛孔纹理、面部细绒毛（peach fuzz）或胡茬、真实皮肤微瑕、锁骨与领口层次。\n- **下部细节**：织物自然垂坠与折痕、面料肌理、手部骨相与青筋、鞋履材质及落地接触阴影。\n- **影棚硬光**：Hard directional Profoto studio strobe key light, deep dramatic facial sculpting shadows, crisp hair rim light.\n\n## 5. Output Format Constraints (输出格式铁律)\n仅输出纯英文提示词，严禁任何中文、标题或标签。严格按以下**六段式结构**换行输出：\n\n[Paragraph 1: 9:16 2x2无边框四宫格声明 + 四格严格统一纯灰无杂物背景声明 + 中画幅棚拍声明 + 角色身份、穿搭与发型总览]\nTop-left panel: [Paragraph 2: 正面胸口以上特写、直视镜头微表情、无磨皮真实毛孔/胡茬/妆容、锁骨与正领细节、纯灰背景]\nTop-right panel: [Paragraph 3: 45度侧颜特写、回眸眼神、下颌线与耳廓高反差光影、侧发纹理、纯灰背景]\nBottom-left panel: [Paragraph 4: 下唇以下保留下巴至脚底的正面全身立姿、双臂自然下垂、正面服装层次与折痕、鞋履与落地阴影]\nBottom-right panel: [Paragraph 5: 后颈以下至脚跟的背面全身立姿、长发拨至胸前露出后领结构、背部剪裁与下装褶皱、鞋跟背面]\n[Paragraph 6: 影棚硬光戏剧性布光、中画幅相机参数、真实未磨皮皮肤质感与负面排除项（zero doors, zero background props, zero soft-focus, zero grid lines）]\n\n## 6. Few-Shot Reference (标准输出范例)\nA vertical 9:16 live-action movie wardrobe test arranged as a borderless seamless 2x2 four-panel grid collage, strictly identical solid neutral medium-grey seamless studio cyclorama backdrop across all 4 panels, zero divider lines, zero background doors or walls. Raw unretouched medium format studio photography of an East Asian street thug leader in his early thirties with a lean build, messy layered dark hair with bleached blonde highlights, wearing an open vintage cream floral Hawaiian shirt over a white ribbed tank top, distressed blue jeans, and brown leather slide sandals.\nTop-left panel: extreme close-up front studio portrait from upper chest to hair top against a plain grey backdrop, head slightly tilted back with a smug smirk, squinting dark eyes with sharp catchlights, unretouched skin pores, patchy chin stubble, prominent Adam's apple, exposed collarbones, open floral camp collar.\nTop-right panel: extreme close-up 45-degree three-quarter profile portrait at exact same scale against a solid grey backdrop, head turned left with a sly glance back at camera, sharp cheekbone and jawline sculpted by hard side lighting, realistic ear anatomy, tousled hair strands.\nBottom-left panel: full-body front standing view cropped horizontally right below the lower lip keeping the lower chin tip visible down to the sandals, arms hanging naturally at sides with visible forearm veins, loose drape of the botanical shirt over the white tank top, ripped knee jeans, brown sandals on the grey floor.\nBottom-right panel: full-body back standing view at identical scale cropped horizontally at the nape of the neck down to the heels, fully exposing the back collar and continuous tropical leaf pattern across the upper back, natural fabric creasing behind the knees, sandal heels grounded by studio floor contact shadows.\nShot on Phase One XF IQ4 150MP, 85mm f/2.8 lens, hard directional studio strobe key light, deep sculpting shadows, high micro-contra